card.statement:
Replace the commutative diagram
<<ref:kjlj1>> with

\begin{equation}
\begin{split}
\xymatrix@R=20pt@C=40pt{
{\mathcal P_2:\hspace{-7mm}}&
{U_2=\mathcal A_1^{-1}(\im \mathcal B_1)}
\ar@<0.3ex>[r]^{\quad\ \mathcal A_2}
\ar@<-0.3ex>[r]_{\quad\ \mathcal B_2}
\ar@<3ex>[d]_{\varphi_2}
&{\im \mathcal B_1=V_2}
\ar@<-3ex>[d]^{\psi_2}
\\
{\mathcal P'_2:\hspace{-7mm}}&
{U_2'=\mathcal A_1'^{-1}(\im
\mathcal B_1')}
\ar@<0.3ex>[r]^{\quad\ \mathcal A'_2}
\ar@<-0.3ex>[r]_{\quad\ \mathcal B'_2}&
{\im \mathcal B'_1=V_2'}
}
\end{split}
\end{equation}

in which $\varphi_2$ and $\psi_2$ are
the restrictions of $\varphi_1$ and
$\psi_1$.
